OL,3,AHouseholds warned gas price spike could
OL,4,Apile fresh pressure on energy bills
OL,5,
OL,6,FHouseholds across the UK are being
OL,7,Fwarned to brace for higher energy bills
OL,8,Fthis winter as European countries
OL,9,Fscramble to replenish their natural gas
OL,10,Fstores before the weather dips.
OL,12,FWholesale natural gas prices are
OL,13,Falready at three-year highs, which
OL,14,Fcould lead to increased energy bills
OL,15,Ffor businesses and consumers.
OL,17,FEurope, which delayed its summer
OL,18,Fstockpiling due to high wholesale costs
OL,19,Fsparked by the Iran war, had been
OL,20,Fgambling the conflict would end before
OL,21,Fwinter and prices would in turn fall.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,111,105,200,300,0,100
