OL,3,AHouseholds warned gas price spike could
OL,4,Apile fresh pressure on energy bills
OL,5,
OL,6,FStorage levels are significantly lower
OL,7,Fthan usual for this time of year, with
OL,8,Fcountries facing the prospect of
OL,9,Frushing to buy gas now or paying
OL,10,Fpotentially higher prices when the
OL,11,Fwinter comes.
